# Cloudflare Web Analytics token.
# Provides page-view counts, unique visitors, geographic location breakdown,
# referrers, and core web vitals — all without cookies.
#
# How to get your token:
#   1. Log in to dash.cloudflare.com
#   2. Go to Web Analytics (left sidebar)
#   3. Click "Add a site" and follow the steps
#   4. Copy the token shown in the beacon snippet
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your token:
VITE_CF_ANALYTICS_TOKEN=
